@startuml MonthlyEvaluation_Sequence
title RubyGYM - Monthly Evaluation

actor Trainer
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend" as BE
database "MySQL" as DB

Trainer -> FE: Open monthly evaluation, pick client + month
FE -> BE: GET /api/trainers/:id/clients
BE --> FE: assigned members (with current goal)
FE -> Trainer: Pre-fill target weight/BMI from member goal

Trainer -> FE: Enter actual weight, actual BMI, notes
FE -> BE: POST /api/evaluations\n{member_id, month_year, actual_weight, actual_bmi, notes}
BE -> BE: Authorize role TRAINER/ADMIN
BE -> DB: SELECT members WHERE id AND trainer_id (ownership)
alt member not owned by trainer
  BE --> FE: 400 "Trainer can only evaluate their own clients"
else owned
  BE -> DB: SELECT existing evaluation (member_id, month_year)
  alt duplicate month
    BE --> FE: 400 "Monthly evaluation already exists"
  else new
    BE -> DB: SELECT training_goals -> fallback target if not provided
    BE -> DB: INSERT INTO monthly_evaluations
    DB --> BE: evaluationId
    BE --> FE: 201 {evaluationId}
    FE --> Trainer: Show success
  end
end
note over BE
Progress (improved/maintained/declined) is computed by
comparing actual vs target (from goal) on read.
Member only views results (UC: View Results).
end note
@enduml
